Subject: [PATCH] docs(process): keep a fixed light-lane review result row

Add an explicit light-lane result row with the reviewed head and evidence. Keep Not run visible and preserve the non-blocking red-light rule. Pin the template in the existing xtask documentation tests.

Co-Authored-By: OpenAI GPT-6.1 Sol <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #3846
